        "id": 2837103,
        "name": "Das Biertier",
        "username": "Das_Biertier",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/das_biertier/{size}/490706_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-10T14:30:01.492Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hello fellow pilots,</p>\n<p>I’ve just released my first custom skill for OpenClaw: An integration with the EVE Online ESI API for easy character management. It supports queries for character info, wallet, assets, skills, clones, location, contracts, mail, and more. Includes a dashboard config system for personalized alerts, reports, and market tracking. Comes with reusable Python scripts for ESI queries and config validation, plus guides for SSO OAuth2.</p>\n<p>•  GitHub Repo: <a href=\"https://github.com/burnshall-ui/openclaw-eve-skill\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/burnshall-ui/openclaw-eve-skill</a></p>\n<p>•  ClawHub Link: <a href=\"https://clawhub.ai/burnshall-ui/eve-esi\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://clawhub.ai/burnshall-ui/eve-esi</a></p>\n<p>Structure is straightforward: Copy to your OpenClaw skills dir, set up your auth, and you’re good. Quick start examples with curl or the bundled scripts. Built this as a hobby on a Ubuntu VPS with Docker.</p>\n<p>If you’re into OpenClaw tools or API stuff, check it out and star the repo if you like it! Feedback or collab ideas? Hit me up. o7</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "posts_count": 2,
